      "id": "FCMO-FF958ED4CB91"
    },
    {
      "type": "edition",
      "date": "2026-09-01"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "GitHub Pages is static: dynamic server-side search is not required. Agents can use the complete search index and deterministic per-object JSON endpoints without scraping HTML.",
